# Review UI Screenshots

Use this repo-local skill after meaningful frontend UI changes.

## Workflow

1. Start the local app with the documented command.
2. Capture screenshots for desktop and mobile viewports.
3. Inspect actual pixels, not just DOM structure.
4. Check text fit, overflow, overlap, loading states, empty states, and primary interactions.
5. Fix visible issues and repeat screenshots until the result is acceptable.
6. Report screenshot paths and remaining UI risks.
